+The named current-revision set is also the concurrency check. If the visit's actual current revisions differ from the set named — a late submission arrived, or the other coordinator resolved first — the resolution is rejected as stale and the coordinator re-reads the contest. With two coordinators working the same queue before a Friday export, a resolution that silently applied to a contest the coordinator never saw would defeat the review it exists to provide.
 
