+| Concurrent resolutions | Optimistic check against the named current-revision set | Last write wins; locking the visit during review | Two coordinators share the queue with no administrator to clear a stuck lock; a stale resolution must fail rather than apply to a contest its author never read. |
+| Divergence point in the contested response | Computed server-side | Client-side traversal of revision history | The server owns the revision graph; every client needing comparison would otherwise re-implement it. |
 
